Package: cobol-ai-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libcob4, curl
Recommends: libsecret-tools
Maintainer: COBOL AI CLI Team <noreply@example.com>
Description: COBOL command-line interface for the Ollama Cloud API
 A CLI written in GnuCOBOL that sends prompts to the Ollama Cloud API and
 displays the responses. Supports one-shot and interactive modes, file
 input, a persistent response cache, retry with HTTP status classification,
 and reading the API key from the system keyring.
